      "id": "claim_cd0b22bb793b461ba062792d4126ebcf",
      "statement": "Provisioner types and their Go structs come from the external smallstep/certificates module (authority/provisioner); the CLI only consumes them via the type switch in NewTokenFlow, so CLI support for a new provisioner type is client-side token generation for a server-side type that already enforces it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://go.mod#L16-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e29935dfc199880a5e8de1c4bd69533efbb13358350d860c4191f7887416e682:"
        },
        {
