          "resource": "repo://utils/cautils/token_generator.go#L275-L310",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a3d14c830857a94d59bc59cb4b7f7fb36d277123a1a2393854371fe81b0638d0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e9d86291bd2d476297064f95e917137e",
      "statement": "Token shape extensions are implemented as token.Options functions that validate the credential and attach it via Claims.SetHeader (e.g. the 'nebula' header) or Claims.Set for extra claims, all of which flow into the jose-signed JWT produced by token/provision.",
